<title>FINLAND: WSOY JUMPS ON 1996 RESULT.</title>
<headline>WSOY JUMPS ON 1996 RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish publishing group WSOY surged on Thursday after the company reported 1996 earnings up three-fold on 1995, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was an excellent result, better than expected,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>At 1220/1020 GMT, WSOY B share traded at 157.80, up 22.70 or almost 17 percent, setting a new post-split life-high.</p>
<p>The little traded share was unusually lively with volume rising to 1.5 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
